 "solution": "\\(1-\\frac{2}{c+1}=\\frac{c+1-2}{c+1}=\\frac{c-1}{c+1}\\)。\n\\(c^{2}+2c+1=(c+1)^{2}\\)。\n原式 \\(=\\frac{(c+1)^{2}}{c-1}\\cdot\\frac{c-1}{c+1}=c+1\\)。",
 "explanation": {
