    "body": "\\(1-\\frac{2}{c+1}=\\frac{c+1-2}{c+1}=\\frac{c-1}{c+1}\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "因式分解",
    "body": "\\(c^{2}+2c+1=(c+1)^{2}\\)。"
   },
   {
